    "src": "assets/img/homelab/unraid-processor-memory.png",
    "alt": "Unraid dashboard panels showing a 12th generation Intel Core i7-12700K processor at 8 percent overall load and 32 GiB of DDR4 memory at 68 percent use, split between the system, the virtual machine and Docker",
